#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit v2.0 migration guide {#qiskit-v20-migration-guide}"
msgstr "Gabay sa migration ng Qiskit v2.0 {#qiskit-v20-migration-guide}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Qiskit v2.0 is the next step within the Qiskit SDK's newly stabilized life cycle.\n"
"This major version does break compatibility with previous versions of Qiskit, but,\n"
"in contrast to the v1.0 release, doesn't involve any changes in the packaging structure.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang Qiskit v2.0 ang susunod na hakbang sa bagong na-stabilize na life cycle ng Qiskit SDK.\n"
"Ang major version na ito ay nakaka-break ng compatibility sa mga nakaraang bersyon ng Qiskit, pero,\n"
"kumpara sa v1.0 release, walang mga pagbabago sa packaging structure.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This guide describes migration paths for the most important feature changes in Qiskit v2.0, organized by module.\n"
"Use the table of contents on the right side to navigate to the module you are interested in.\n"
msgstr ""
"Inilalarawan ng gabay na ito ang mga migration path para sa pinakamahalagang pagbabago sa features ng Qiskit v2.0, nakaayos ayon sa module.\n"
"Gamitin ang table of contents sa kanang bahagi para pumunta sa module na interesado ka.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Read more about the benefits of Qiskit v2.0 on the [IBM&reg; "
"blog](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/qiskit-2-0-release-summary).\n"
msgstr ""
"Basahin pa ang mga benepisyo ng Qiskit v2.0 sa [IBM&reg; "
"blog](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/qiskit-2-0-release-summary).\n"

