#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Removal of legacy `c_if` conditions {#removal-of-legacy-c-if-conditions}"
msgstr ""
"Pagtanggal ng legacy na `c_if` conditions {#removal-of-legacy-c-if-"
"conditions}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Classical conditions in Qiskit have been preferentially represented by the instruction [`IfElseOp`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.IfElseOp) since before Qiskit v1.0.\n"
"These operations are typically added to a [`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit) by using the [`if_test`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit.if_test) method as a context manager.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang mga classical condition sa Qiskit ay mas pinipiling katawanin ng instruction na [`IfElseOp`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.IfElseOp) mula pa bago ang Qiskit v1.0.\n"
"Ang mga operasyong ito ay karaniwang idinadagdag sa isang [`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit) gamit ang paraan na [`if_test`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit.if_test) bilang isang context manager.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This also means that the "
"[`Instruction`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.Instruction)"
" no longer has a `condition` attribute, and that you cannot chain `c_if` "
"calls on the output of a "
"[`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit)"
" gate-creating method call.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ibig sabihin din nito na ang "
"[`Instruction`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.Instruction)"
" ay wala nang `condition` attribute, at hindi mo na maaaring i-chain ang mga"
" `c_if` na tawag sa output ng isang method call na lumilikha ng gate sa "
"[`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The only instructions that might have a condition now are [`IfElseOp`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.IfElseOp) and [`WhileLoopOp`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.WhileLoopOp).\n"
"The most correct way to test for a condition is to use an `isinstance` check to validate that you have the correct class.\n"
"If you want to support the legacy `Instruction.condition` attribute during your library's transition to Qiskit v2.0 and later, you can use `getattr(operation, \"condition\", None)`, which will typically cause `Instruction` instances to behave as they did in Qiskit v1.x and earlier.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang mga tanging instruction na maaaring may condition ngayon ay [`IfElseOp`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.IfElseOp) at [`WhileLoopOp`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.WhileLoopOp) lamang.\n"
"Ang pinakatamang paraan para suriin ang isang condition ay gumamit ng `isinstance` check para matiyak na tama ang klase.\n"
"Kung gusto mong suportahan ang legacy na `Instruction.condition` attribute habang nag-e-transition ang iyong library sa Qiskit v2.0 at mas bago, maaari kang gumamit ng `getattr(operation, \"condition\", None)`, na kadalasan ay magiging dahilan para kumilos ang mga `Instruction` instance gaya ng ginawa nila sa Qiskit v1.x at mas luma.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The original, legacy method of supporting simple register-equality conditions in Qiskit was to use the `c_if` method on individual instructions or instruction sets.\n"
"This was strictly less featureful than the full control-flow form, and was never well-supported on hardware.\n"
"This legacy method has been removed in Qiskit v2.0; you should use the [`if_test`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit.if_test) method with a proper condition.\n"
"You can continue to use the 2-tuple form of `(register, integer)` to represent a register equality, or you can use the more expressive [classical computation subsystem](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit_classical) to represent more complex conditions.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang orihinal, legacy na paraan ng pag-suporta sa simpleng register-equality conditions sa Qiskit ay ang paggamit ng `c_if` method sa mga indibidwal na instruction o instruction sets.\n"
"Ito ay mahigpit na kulang sa features kumpara sa buong control-flow form, at hindi kailanman maayos na sinuportahan sa hardware.\n"
"Ang legacy na pamamaraang ito ay inalis na sa Qiskit v2.0; dapat kang gumamit ng paraan na [`if_test`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit.if_test) na may tamang condition.\n"
"Maaari kang patuloy na gumamit ng 2-tuple form na `(register, integer)` para kumatawan ng register equality, o maaari kang gumamit ng mas mapaghayag na [classical computation subsystem](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit_classical) para kumatawan ng mas kumplikadong conditions.\n"

