#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "For example, you might have written:\n"
msgstr "Halimbawa, maaaring nasulat mo ito:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The most direct translation of this is to use the 2-tuple form with the "
"[`if_test`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit.if_test)"
" context manager:\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang pinakadirektang pagsasalin nito ay ang paggamit ng 2-tuple form kasama "
"ang "
"[`if_test`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit.if_test)"
" context manager:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Note that in this form, you can also have the conditional gate access to multiple operations (simply add more into the indented block) without re-evaluating the conditions.\n"
"You can also provide an ``else`` statement, and use more complex conditional logic:\n"
msgstr ""
"Pansinin na sa form na ito, maaari ka ring magbigay ng access sa conditional gate sa maraming operasyon (idagdag lang ang mga ito sa indented block) nang hindi muling sinusuri ang mga condition.\n"
"Maaari ka ring magbigay ng ``else`` statement, at gumamit ng mas kumplikadong conditional logic:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"instruction_durations\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"instruction_durations\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Removal of `Instruction.duration` and `Instruction.unit` {#removal-of-"
"instructionduration-and-instructionunit}"
msgstr ""
"Pagtanggal ng `Instruction.duration` at `Instruction.unit` {#removal-of-"
"instructionduration-and-instructionunit}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Circuit [`Instruction`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.Instruction) objects previously had attributes called `duration` and `unit`.\n"
"These no longer exist in Qiskit v2.0.\n"
"This is because the field generally only duplicated information that was a fixed property of hardware, and was stored explicitly in the [`Target`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target).\n"
"Storing the information separately for each individual instruction significantly increased the memory demands of Qiskit and slowed down even circuit operations that did not directly need to touch the information.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang mga Circuit [`Instruction`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.Instruction) objects ay dati'y may mga attribute na tinatawag na `duration` at `unit`.\n"
"Wala na ang mga ito sa Qiskit v2.0.\n"
"Ito ay dahil ang field sa pangkalahatan ay nagdo-duplicate lamang ng impormasyon na isang fixed property ng hardware, at tahasan itong nakaimbak sa [`Target`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target).\n"
"Ang pag-iimbak ng impormasyon nang hiwalay para sa bawat indibidwal na instruction ay malaki ang dagdag sa memory requirements ng Qiskit at nagpabagal pa kahit sa mga circuit na operasyon na hindi direktang kailangan ng impormasyon.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The [`Delay`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit#delay) "
"instruction still contains these fields, as does the new-in-v2.0 "
"[`BoxOp`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#box),"
" because these instructions have a _variable_ delay.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang [`Delay`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit#delay) "
"instruction ay nagtataglay pa rin ng mga field na ito, gayundin ang bagong "
"[`BoxOp`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#box)"
" na idinagdag sa v2.0, dahil ang mga instruction na ito ay may _variable_ na"
" delay.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can retrieve the hardware-specified duration of a particular hardware-supported [`Instruction`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.Instruction) by querying the [`Target`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target).\n"
"To do this, index the [`Target`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target) first with the operation's name, and then the indices of the hardware qubits as a tuple.\n"
"This will return either `None` (if the instruction is supported, but no specific properties were assigned to it), or an [`InstructionProperties`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.InstructionProperties) instance, from which the [`duration`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.InstructionProperties#qiskit.transpiler.InstructionProperties.duration) field may provide the duration in seconds (or `None`, if not supplied).\n"
msgstr ""
"Maaari mong makuha ang hardware-specified na duration ng isang partikular na hardware-supported na [`Instruction`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.Instruction) sa pamamagitan ng pag-query sa [`Target`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target).\n"
"Para gawin ito, i-index muna ang [`Target`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target) gamit ang pangalan ng operasyon, pagkatapos ay ang mga index ng hardware qubits bilang isang tuple.\n"
"Ibabalik nito ang `None` (kung sinusuportahan ang instruction, pero walang partikular na properties na itinalaga dito), o isang [`InstructionProperties`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.InstructionProperties) instance, kung saan maaaring magbigay ng duration sa segundo ang field na [`duration`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.InstructionProperties#qiskit.transpiler.InstructionProperties.duration) (o `None`, kung hindi ibinigay).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In general, as classical control-flow becomes more common within circuit executions, the \"duration\" of a circuit will become less and less well defined.\n"
"While Qiskit v2.x still includes the [`QuantumCircuit.duration`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit.duration) attribute, it is recommended to move away from it, as it will likely be removed in the future; the assumptions under which it is valid will be violated more and more frequently.\n"
"Instead, you can use the new [`QuantumCircuit.estimate_duration`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit.estimate_duration) method, which is safer and clearer about the necessary assumptions.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sa pangkalahatan, habang nagiging mas karaniwan ang classical control-flow sa loob ng mga circuit execution, ang \"duration\" ng isang circuit ay magiging lalong hindi malinaw ang kahulugan.\n"
"Bagama't kasama pa rin sa Qiskit v2.x ang attribute na [`QuantumCircuit.duration`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit.duration), inirerekomenda na lumayo na rito, dahil malamang na aalisin ito sa hinaharap; ang mga pagpapalagay kung saan ito valid ay mabibigo nang mas madalas at madalas.\n"
"Sa halip, maaari mong gamitin ang bagong paraan na [`QuantumCircuit.estimate_duration`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit.estimate_duration), na mas ligtas at mas malinaw tungkol sa mga kinakailangang pagpapalagay.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"qiskit.transpiler\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"qiskit.transpiler\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "qiskit.transpiler {#qiskittranspiler}"
msgstr "qiskit.transpiler {#qiskittranspiler}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"generate_preset_pass_manager\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"generate_preset_pass_manager\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Changes to `generate_preset_pass_manager` interface {#changes-to-generate-"
"preset-pass-manager-interface}"
msgstr ""
"Mga pagbabago sa interface ng `generate_preset_pass_manager` {#changes-to-"
"generate-preset-pass-manager-interface}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Qiskit v2.0.0 includes a series of updates to the preset pass manager interface (that is, the\n"
"[`generate_preset_pass_manager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager) and\n"
"[`transpile`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/compiler#transpile) functions) that affect the\n"
"handling of loose constraint inputs, such as `coupling_map` or `basis_gates`. The number of\n"
"transpilation use cases where loose constraints are accepted has been reduced in favor of the\n"
"`target` and `backend` inputs (where `backend` is a [`BackendV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.BackendV2) that\n"
"contains a [`Target`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target) instance),\n"
"which allow for a more expressive communication of these constraints.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang Qiskit v2.0.0 ay naglalaman ng serye ng mga update sa preset pass manager interface (iyon ay, ang mga function na\n"
"[`generate_preset_pass_manager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager) at\n"
"[`transpile`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/compiler#transpile)) na nakakaapekto sa\n"
"paghawak ng loose constraint inputs, tulad ng `coupling_map` o `basis_gates`. Nabawasan ang bilang ng\n"
"mga transpilation use case kung saan tinatanggap ang loose constraints pabor sa\n"
"`target` at `backend` inputs (kung saan ang `backend` ay isang [`BackendV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.BackendV2) na\n"
"naglalaman ng isang [`Target`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target) instance),\n"
"na nagbibigay-daan sa mas mapaghayag na komunikasyon ng mga constraint na ito.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The following examples show the main changes and suggested alternatives for migrating. Note that all\n"
"of the migration tips below apply to both `transpile` and `generate_preset_pass_manager`:\n"
msgstr ""
"Ipinapakita ng mga sumusunod na halimbawa ang mga pangunahing pagbabago at mga mungkahing alternatibo para sa migration. Pansinin na lahat ng\n"
"mga tip sa migration sa ibaba ay naaangkop sa parehong `transpile` at `generate_preset_pass_manager`:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The `backend_properties` input argument is no longer supported, and the `BackendProperties` class has\n"
"been removed. You should use the `target` or `backend` arguments instead to communicate\n"
"gate durations and errors. There are multiple paths for constructing a custom [`Target`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target):\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang input argument na `backend_properties` ay hindi na sinusuportahan, at inalis na ang klase na `BackendProperties`.\n"
"Dapat mong gamitin ang mga argument na `target` o `backend` sa halip para ipahayag ang\n"
"mga gate duration at error. Maraming paraan para bumuo ng custom na [`Target`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target):\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  a. Build a target from scratch and add the relevant errors and durations "
"to the corresponding gates:\n"
msgstr ""
"  a. Bumuo ng target mula sa simula at idagdag ang mga kaugnay na error at "
"duration sa mga katumbas na gate:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```python\n"
"    from qiskit.transpiler import (\n"
"    Target, InstructionProperties, generate_preset_pass_manager)\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```python\n"
"    from qiskit.transpiler import (\n"
"    Target, InstructionProperties, generate_preset_pass_manager)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "    from qiskit.circuit.library import XGate, CXGate\n"
msgstr "    from qiskit.circuit.library import XGate, CXGate\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    target = Target(num_qubits=2)\n"
"    target.add_instruction(\n"
"    CXGate(), {(0, 1): InstructionProperties(error=.0001, duration=5e-7)})\n"
msgstr ""
"    target = Target(num_qubits=2)\n"
"    target.add_instruction(\n"
"    CXGate(), {(0, 1): InstructionProperties(error=.0001, duration=5e-7)})\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    target.add_instruction(\n"
"        XGate(),\n"
"        {\n"
"            (0,): InstructionProperties(error=.00001, duration=5e-8),\n"
"            (1,): InstructionProperties(error=.00002, duration=6e-8)\n"
"        }\n"
"    )\n"
msgstr ""
"    target.add_instruction(\n"
"        XGate(),\n"
"        {\n"
"            (0,): InstructionProperties(error=.00001, duration=5e-8),\n"
"            (1,): InstructionProperties(error=.00002, duration=6e-8)\n"
"        }\n"
"    )\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    pm = generate_preset_pass_manager(target=target)\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""
"    pm = generate_preset_pass_manager(target=target)\n"
"    ```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  b. Use [`GenericBackendV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.fake_provider.GenericBackendV2) to quickly build a\n"
"     generic target with pre-filled errors and durations. These can also be updated post-construction:\n"
msgstr ""
"  b. Gamitin ang [`GenericBackendV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.fake_provider.GenericBackendV2) para mabilis na bumuo ng\n"
"     generic target na may pre-filled na mga error at duration. Maaari rin itong i-update pagkatapos ng construction:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```python\n"
"    from qiskit.providers.fake_provider import GenericBackendV2\n"
"    from qiskit.transpiler import generate_preset_pass_manager\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```python\n"
"    from qiskit.providers.fake_provider import GenericBackendV2\n"
"    from qiskit.transpiler import generate_preset_pass_manager\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    target = GenericBackendV2(num_qubits=2, basis_gates=[\"x\", \"cx\"]).target\n"
"    target.update_instruction_properties(\"x\", (0,), InstructionProperties(0.00001))\n"
"    target.update_instruction_properties(\"x\", (1,), InstructionProperties(0.00002))\n"
"    target.update_instruction_properties(\"cx\", (0, 1), InstructionProperties(0.0001))\n"
msgstr ""
"    target = GenericBackendV2(num_qubits=2, basis_gates=[\"x\", \"cx\"]).target\n"
"    target.update_instruction_properties(\"x\", (0,), InstructionProperties(0.00001))\n"
"    target.update_instruction_properties(\"x\", (1,), InstructionProperties(0.00002))\n"
"    target.update_instruction_properties(\"cx\", (0, 1), InstructionProperties(0.0001))\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"2. The `instruction_durations` and `timing_constraints` input arguments are no longer supported. You should use the\n"
"  `target` or `backend` arguments instead. The alternatives are constructing a custom [`Target`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target) from\n"
"  scratch, constructing a generic backend, and, in addition to these, it is possible to build a custom target with\n"
"  `instruction_durations` and/or `timing_constraints` using the `Target.from_configuration` method:\n"
msgstr ""
"2. Ang mga input argument na `instruction_durations` at `timing_constraints` ay hindi na sinusuportahan. Dapat mong gamitin ang\n"
"  mga argument na `target` o `backend` sa halip. Ang mga alternatibo ay ang pagbuo ng custom na [`Target`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target) mula sa\n"
"  simula, pagbuo ng generic backend, at bilang karagdagan sa mga ito, posible ring bumuo ng custom target gamit ang\n"
"  `instruction_durations` at/o `timing_constraints` gamit ang paraan na `Target.from_configuration`:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```python\n"
"    from qiskit.transpiler import Target, generate_preset_pass_manager\n"
"    from qiskit.transpiler.timing_constraints import TimingConstraints\n"
"    from qiskit.transpiler.instruction_durations import InstructionDurations\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```python\n"
"    from qiskit.transpiler import Target, generate_preset_pass_manager\n"
"    from qiskit.transpiler.timing_constraints import TimingConstraints\n"
"    from qiskit.transpiler.instruction_durations import InstructionDurations\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    instruction_durations = InstructionDurations(\n"
"      [(\"x\", None, 200), (\"cx\", None, 1000)], dt=1e-7)\n"
msgstr ""
"    instruction_durations = InstructionDurations(\n"
"      [(\"x\", None, 200), (\"cx\", None, 1000)], dt=1e-7)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    timing_constraints = TimingConstraints(\n"
"            granularity=1, min_length=1, pulse_alignment=1, acquire_alignment=1\n"
"        )\n"
msgstr ""
"    timing_constraints = TimingConstraints(\n"
"            granularity=1, min_length=1, pulse_alignment=1, acquire_alignment=1\n"
"        )\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    target = Target.from_configuration(num_qubits=2,\n"
"                                      basis_gates=[\"x\", \"cx\"],\n"
"                                      instruction_durations=instruction_durations,\n"
"                                      timing_constraints=timing_constraints)\n"
msgstr ""
"    target = Target.from_configuration(num_qubits=2,\n"
"                                      basis_gates=[\"x\", \"cx\"],\n"
"                                      instruction_durations=instruction_durations,\n"
"                                      timing_constraints=timing_constraints)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"3. Providing `coupling_map` and/or `basis_gates` along with a `backend` is discouraged, and from\n"
"  v2.0 a `UserWarning` will be raised. In these cases there are multiple sources of truth,\n"
"  and information such as gate errors and durations from the backend cannot be resolved based on the\n"
"  information given.\n"
"  The suggested alternative is to define a custom target that combines the chosen constraints either\n"
"  from scratch, using [`Target.from_configuration`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target#from_configuration) or [`GenericBackendV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.fake_provider.GenericBackendV2).\n"
msgstr ""
"3. Ang pagbibigay ng `coupling_map` at/o `basis_gates` kasama ang isang `backend` ay hindi inirerekomenda, at mula sa\n"
"  v2.0 ay maglalabas na ito ng `UserWarning`. Sa mga kasong ito ay maraming pinagkukunan ng katotohanan,\n"
"  at ang impormasyon tulad ng mga gate error at duration mula sa backend ay hindi malulutas batay sa\n"
"  impormasyong ibinigay.\n"
"  Ang mungkahing alternatibo ay ang pagtukoy ng custom target na pinagsama ang mga piniling constraint alinman\n"
"  mula sa simula, gamit ang [`Target.from_configuration`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target#from_configuration) o [`GenericBackendV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.fake_provider.GenericBackendV2).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"4. The `basis_gates` argument no longer accepts custom basis gates. The suggested alternative\n"
"  is the `target` argument, which can be built from scratch or through [`Target.from_configuration`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target#from_configuration)\n"
"  such as:\n"
msgstr ""
"4. Ang argument na `basis_gates` ay hindi na tumatanggap ng mga custom basis gate. Ang mungkahing alternatibo\n"
"  ay ang argument na `target`, na maaaring buuin mula sa simula o sa pamamagitan ng [`Target.from_configuration`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target#from_configuration)\n"
"  tulad ng:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```python\n"
"    from qiskit.circuit.library import XGate\n"
"    from qiskit.transpiler.target import Target\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```python\n"
"    from qiskit.circuit.library import XGate\n"
"    from qiskit.transpiler.target import Target\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    basis_gates = [\"my_x\", \"cx\"]\n"
"    custom_name_mapping = {\"my_x\": XGate()}\n"
"    target = Target.from_configuration(\n"
"        basis_gates=basis_gates, num_qubits=2, \n"
"        custom_name_mapping=custom_name_mapping\n"
"    )\n"
"    pm = generate_preset_pass_manager(target=target)\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""
"    basis_gates = [\"my_x\", \"cx\"]\n"
"    custom_name_mapping = {\"my_x\": XGate()}\n"
"    target = Target.from_configuration(\n"
"        basis_gates=basis_gates, num_qubits=2, \n"
"        custom_name_mapping=custom_name_mapping\n"
"    )\n"
"    pm = generate_preset_pass_manager(target=target)\n"
"    ```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"5. The input combination where a custom `coupling_map` is provided with either a `backend` or `basis_gates`\n"
"  that contain gates with three or more qubits is no longer allowed. The coupling map\n"
"  does not provide the necessary connectivity details to be able to determine the  action of the gate.\n"
"  In these cases, the recommended migration path is the creation of a custom target from scratch.\n"
msgstr ""
"5. Ang input combination kung saan ibinibigay ang custom na `coupling_map` kasama ang `backend` o `basis_gates`\n"
"  na naglalaman ng mga gate na may tatlo o higit pang Qubit ay hindi na pinapayagan. Ang coupling map\n"
"  ay hindi nagbibigay ng kinakailangang connectivity details para matukoy ang aksyon ng gate.\n"
"  Sa mga kasong ito, ang inirerekomendang migration path ay ang paglikha ng custom target mula sa simula.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"6. The `inst_map` argument has been removed without alternative. It was used to provide pulse information\n"
"  to the transpiler, and the full `qiskit.pulse` module has been removed.\n"
msgstr ""
"6. Ang argument na `inst_map` ay inalis nang walang alternatibo. Ginamit ito para magbigay ng pulse information\n"
"  sa transpiler, at ang buong module na `qiskit.pulse` ay inalis na.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"qiskit.pulse\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"qiskit.pulse\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "qiskit.pulse {#qiskitpulse}"
msgstr "qiskit.pulse {#qiskitpulse}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The module `qiskit.pulse` has been completely removed from Qiskit, without replacement.\n"
"This includes the related items:\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang module na `qiskit.pulse` ay ganap na inalis sa Qiskit, nang walang kapalit.\n"
"Kasama rito ang mga kaugnay na aytem:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"the "
"[`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit),"
" "
"[`DAGCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.dagcircuit.DAGCircuit)"
" and "
"[`DAGDependency`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.dagcircuit.DAGDependency)"
" property `calibrations`.\n"
msgstr ""
"ang property na `calibrations` ng "
"[`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit),"
" "
"[`DAGCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.dagcircuit.DAGCircuit)"
" at "
"[`DAGDependency`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.dagcircuit.DAGDependency).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"the "
"[`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit)"
" methods `has_calibration_for` and `add_calibration`.\n"
msgstr ""
"ang mga paraan ng "
"[`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit)"
" na `has_calibration_for` at `add_calibration`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"the "
"[`DAGCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.dagcircuit.DAGCircuit)"
" method `has_calibration_for`.\n"
msgstr ""
"ang paraan ng "
"[`DAGCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.dagcircuit.DAGCircuit)"
" na `has_calibration_for`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"the transpiler passes `PulseGates`, `RXCalibrationBuilder`, "
"`RZXCalibrationBuilder`, `EchoRZXWeylDecomposition`, `ValidatePulseGates`.\n"
msgstr ""
"ang mga transpiler pass na `PulseGates`, `RXCalibrationBuilder`, "
"`RZXCalibrationBuilder`, `EchoRZXWeylDecomposition`, `ValidatePulseGates`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "the module `qiskit.scheduler` and all its contents.\n"
msgstr "ang module na `qiskit.scheduler` at lahat ng nilalaman nito.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"the "
"[`BackendV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.BackendV2)"
" methods `instruction_schedule_map`, `drive_channel`, `measure_channel`, "
"`acquire_channel` and `control_channel`.\n"
msgstr ""
"ang mga paraan ng "
"[`BackendV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.BackendV2)"
" na `instruction_schedule_map`, `drive_channel`, `measure_channel`, "
"`acquire_channel` at `control_channel`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"the "
"[`Target`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target)"
" methods `has_calibration`, `get_calibration`, `instruction_schedule_map` "
"and `update_from_instruction_schedule_map`.\n"
msgstr ""
"ang mga paraan ng "
"[`Target`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target)"
" na `has_calibration`, `get_calibration`, `instruction_schedule_map` at "
"`update_from_instruction_schedule_map`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"the `inst_map` argument of "
"[`generate_preset_pass_manager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager),"
" [`transpile`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/compiler#transpile), "
"and "
"[`Target.from_configuration`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target#qiskit.transpiler.Target.from_configuration).\n"
msgstr ""
"ang argument na `inst_map` ng "
"[`generate_preset_pass_manager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager),"
" [`transpile`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/compiler#transpile), "
"at "
"[`Target.from_configuration`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target#qiskit.transpiler.Target.from_configuration).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"the `calibration` field of "
"[`InstructionProperties`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.InstructionProperties).\n"
msgstr ""
"ang field na `calibration` ng "
"[`InstructionProperties`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.InstructionProperties).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This happened because IBM Quantum&reg; QPUs ceased to offer pulse-level access, and the Qiskit team no longer had resources to maintain the little-used package.\n"
"You can continue to use the `qiskit.pulse` module while using the v1.x series of Qiskit, which has bug-fix support until September 2024 and security support until March 2025, but the module is removed from the v2.x series.\n"
msgstr ""
"Nangyari ito dahil ang IBM Quantum&reg; QPUs ay tumigil sa pag-aalok ng pulse-level access, at ang Qiskit team ay wala nang rekurso para mapanatili ang bihirang gamiting package.\n"
"Maaari kang patuloy na gumamit ng module na `qiskit.pulse` habang ginagamit ang v1.x series ng Qiskit, na may bug-fix support hanggang Setyembre 2024 at security support hanggang Marso 2025, pero ang module ay inalis na sa v2.x series.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Most uses of `qiskit.pulse` can be replaced with direct access to fractional gates on IBM Quantum Heron QPUs (and later generations, if applicable).\n"
"You can read more in [the migration guide for converted pulse usage to fractional gates](/guides/pulse-migration).\n"
msgstr ""
"Karamihan sa mga paggamit ng `qiskit.pulse` ay maaaring palitan ng direktang access sa mga fractional gate sa IBM Quantum Heron QPUs (at mga susunod na henerasyon, kung naaangkop).\n"
"Maaari kang magbasa pa sa [gabay sa migration para sa na-convert na pulse usage papunta sa fractional gates](/guides/pulse-migration).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can no longer load QPY files that contain `ScheduleBlock` objects in Qiskit v2.0 because of the removal of Qiskit Pulse.\n"
"You can continue to load these files in the Qiskit v1.x series.\n"
msgstr ""
"Hindi mo na maaaring mag-load ng mga QPY file na naglalaman ng mga `ScheduleBlock` object sa Qiskit v2.0 dahil sa pag-aalis ng Qiskit Pulse.\n"
"Maaari kang patuloy na mag-load ng mga file na ito sa Qiskit v1.x series.\n"
